<title>JAPAN: Japan Dec silver imports rise 10.8 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Japan Dec silver imports rise 10.8 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's silver imports in December rose 10.8 percent from a year earlier to 36.00 tonnes, Finance Ministry data released on Monday showed.</p>
<p>The figures released by MOF were as follows (in tonnes):</p>
<p>			Dec 96     Nov 96	  Dec 95</p>
<p> Total		 36.00	91.09	   32.48</p>
<p>Major suppliers:</p>
<p> Mexico		18.01	36.01	   18.02</p>
<p> U.S.		   0.00	12.86	    0.00</p>
<p>Cumulative imports in 1996 were 1,228.15 tonnes against 1,177.42 the year before.</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Commodities Desk +81-3-3432-6179</p>
</text>
